# The screws limit the velocity loop: at vel_bw 1200 rad/s the Y table's
# screw mode (the 40 kg table on ~45 N/um) goes unstable and the drive
# trips; mill_circle.test runs the default 500 (machine/x.conf ...).
@program mill/mill_sim
@args mill/machine/cn720.mill
drv all pid0.vel_bw = 1200
lcnc 1
run 0.3
mark
move 0.3 340 205 -20
run 0.5
print fault max_ferr_y
@expect mill.fault == 1
@expect mill.max_ferr_y > 50
